            "source_title": "P0-02 Synthetic Yunnan Travel Guide",
            "source_path": "Synthetic Evaluation / Yunnan",
            "doc_type": "faq",
            "region": "yunnan",
            "product_name": "Synthetic Yunnan Family Tour",
            "section": "Airport Transfers",
            "chunk_index": 0,
            "chunk_strategy": "heading_section",
            "text": "云南亲子游包含昆明机场与市区酒店之间的抵达和离开接送。其他城市接送需另行确认。 Yunnan family tours include arrival and departure transfers between Kunming Airport and city hotels. Transfers in other cities require confirmation.",
            "last_edited_time": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z"
          },
          "sha256": "348399f764a03f6d42234c07488a6eda07acbf0f3347a470ce536422341f726e",
          "valid_from": null,
          "valid_to": null,
          "validity_basis": "evaluation_time",
          "conflict_key": null,
          "conflict_value": null
        },
        {
          "chunk": {
            "chunk_id": "exclusions",
            "source_type": "notion_page",
            "notion_page_id": "synthetic-p002-exclusions",
            "source_title": "P0-02 Synthetic Yunnan Travel Guide",
            "source_path": "Synthetic Evaluation / Yunnan",
            "doc_type": "faq",
            "region": "yunnan",
            "product_name": "Synthetic Yunnan Family Tour",
            "section": "Exclusions",
            "chunk_index": 0,
            "chunk_strategy": "heading_section",
            "text": "云南亲子游不包含国际机票和个人旅行保险，旅客需自行安排。 International flights and personal travel insurance are not included in the Yunnan family tour. Travelers arrange these separately.",
            "last_edited_time": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z"
          },
          "sha256": "5fef15865a301eb10c6b9772c4620ea03799c308c590a6b4628a867383c07e93",
          "valid_from": null,
          "valid_to": null,
          "validity_basis": "evaluation_time",
          "conflict_key": null,
          "conflict_value": null
        },
        {
          "chunk": {
            "chunk_id": "payment",
            "source_type": "notion_page",
            "notion_page_id": "synthetic-p002-payment",
            "source_title": "P0-02 Synthetic Yunnan Travel Guide",
            "source_path": "Synthetic Evaluation / Yunnan",
            "doc_type": "faq",
            "region": "yunnan",
            "product_name": "Synthetic Yunnan Family Tour",
            "section": "Payment Conditions",
            "chunk_index": 0,
            "chunk_strategy": "heading_section",
            "text": "书面行程和明细报价双方确认后，支付总价30%的定金；余款在抵达前14天支付。 A 30% deposit is due after both parties confirm the written itinerary and itemized quotation. The balance is due 14 days before arrival.",
            "last_edited_time": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z"
          },
          "sha256": "e0071fc32db88aea79038eb7f5b8b375217b2a3777df1fd8f15237012565d1ab",
          "valid_from": null,
          "valid_to": null,
          "validity_basis": "evaluation_time",
          "conflict_key": null,
          "conflict_value": null
        },
        {
          "chunk": {
            "chunk_id": "itinerary",
            "source_type": "notion_page",
            "notion_page_id": "synthetic-p002-itinerary",
            "source_title": "P0-02 Synthetic Yunnan Travel Guide",
            "source_path": "Synthetic Evaluation / Yunnan",
            "doc_type": "faq",
            "region": "yunnan",
            "product_name": "Synthetic Yunnan Family Tour",
            "section": "Itinerary",
            "chunk_index": 0,
            "chunk_strategy": "heading_section",
            "text": "云南亲子游标准行程为7天6晚，路线是昆明—大理—丽江—香格里拉。 The standard Yunnan family itinerary lasts 7 days and 6 nights: Kunming, Dali, Lijiang and Shangri-La.",
            "last_edited_time": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z"
          },
          "sha256": "0ed2b72ac861700399af25fe09aa41a79171b7d784898129ad01934b719fbf2a",
          "valid_from": null,
          "valid_to": null,
          "validity_basis": "evaluation_time",
          "conflict_key": null,
          "conflict_value": null
        },
        {
          "chunk": {
            "chunk_id": "quote",
            "source_type": "notion_page",
            "notion_page_id": "synthetic-p002-quote",
            "source_title": "P0-02 Synthetic Yunnan Travel Guide",
            "source_path": "Synthetic Evaluation / Yunnan",
            "doc_type": "faq",
            "region": "yunnan",
            "product_name": "Synthetic Yunnan Family Tour",
            "section": "Pricing Variables",
            "chunk_index": 0,
            "chunk_strategy": "heading_section",
            "text": "私人定制游价格取决于人数、旅行日期、酒店等级和车辆要求。此资料不提供具体金额，也不证明任何日期的余位。 Private tour pricing depends on group size, travel dates, hotel category and vehicle requirements. This guide provides no exact amount or date-specific availability.",
            "last_edited_time": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z"
          },
          "sha256": "29fd4b721a2f441017cffee9f13559be525da8b384c2f414aef8b6cca234cc3d",
          "valid_from": null,
          "valid_to": null,
          "validity_basis": "evaluation_time",
          "conflict_key": null,
          "conflict_value": null
        },
        {
          "chunk": {
            "chunk_id": "guide_eligibility",
            "source_type": "notion_page",
            "notion_page_id": "synthetic-p002-guide_eligibility",
            "source_title": "P0-02 Synthetic Yunnan Travel Guide",
            "source_path": "Synthetic Evaluation / Yunnan",
            "doc_type": "faq",
            "region": "yunnan",
            "product_name": "Synthetic Yunnan Family Tour",
            "section": "Guide Eligibility",
            "chunk_index": 0,
            "chunk_strategy": "heading_section",
            "text": "云南亲子游的已确认亲子团队可以使用本产品的随团导游服务。下一节规定该服务的工作时段。 Confirmed family groups on the Yunnan family product may use its accompanying guide service. The service hours are specified separately.",
            "last_edited_time": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z"
          },
          "sha256": "11ee7f94b7a6fb7d9c7ff2a7166423b6372eedcc658ab8951c468617bdc3e220",
          "valid_from": null,
          "valid_to": null,
          "validity_basis": "evaluation_time",
          "conflict_key": null,
          "conflict_value": null
        },
        {
          "chunk": {
            "chunk_id": "guide_hours",
            "source_type": "notion_page",
            "notion_page_id": "synthetic-p002-guide_hours",
            "source_title": "P0-02 Synthetic Yunnan Travel Guide",
            "source_path": "Synthetic Evaluation / Yunnan",
            "doc_type": "faq",
            "region": "yunnan",
            "product_name": "Synthetic Yunnan Family Tour",
            "section": "Guide Service Hours",
            "chunk_index": 0,
            "chunk_strategy": "heading_section",
            "text": "本产品随团导游的服务时间为每日09:00至17:00；此处不单独说明哪些客人适用。 This product offers accompanying guide service from 09:00 to 17:00 daily; eligibility is specified separately.",
            "last_edited_time": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z"
          },
          "sha256": "75599287f2107a36b9dbe917f3daefbe059e48753463a6ee1cad2fe2d5bc49aa",
          "valid_from": null,
          "valid_to": null,
          "validity_basis": "evaluation_time",
          "conflict_key": null,
          "conflict_value": null
        },
        {
          "chunk": {
            "chunk_id": "hotel_intro",
            "source_type": "notion_page",
            "notion_page_id": "synthetic-p002-hotel_intro",
            "source_title": "P0-02 Synthetic Yunnan Travel Guide",
            "source_path": "Synthetic Evaluation / Yunnan",
            "doc_type": "faq",
            "region": "yunnan",
            "product_name": "Synthetic Yunnan Family Tour",
            "section": "Hotel Introduction",
            "chunk_index": 0,
            "chunk_strategy": "heading_section",
            "text": "本产品可选择昆明市区亲子酒店。酒店介绍仅供行程规划；资料没有儿童房价、指定日期房态或预订凭证。 Family-friendly hotels in central Kunming are possible itinerary options. This description contains no child room price, date-specific availability or booking confirmation.",
